<title>PORTUGAL: Bank of Portugal injects 30 bln esc, 7.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Portugal injects 30 bln esc, 7.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it injected 30 billion escudos of seven-day funds into the money market at a weighted average rate of 7.0 percent in a variable rate repurchase tender for the beginning of a new commercial bank reserves period which starts on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The central bank last injected funds this morning at 7.0125 percent. -- LISBON BUREAU 3511-3538254</p>
